  "prefLabel": "Auc 304.03 Examination Fee",
  "priorExpiration": "2006-01-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Auc 304.03 Examination Fee. The fee for registration for the New Hampshire auctioneer's licensing examination shall be $75.00. This fee includes the provision of a copy of the auctioneer licensing bulletin. Copies of pages of this document may also be obtained separately by paying the per page copying fee specified in Auc 104.03.\n\nSource. #6658, eff 1-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-1-06\n\nNew. #12201-B, eff 6-7-17 (from Auc 305.03)",
